sync components
  file
    schemes: ["file:"]
    capabilities: fetcher,default-triggers
  fsnotify
    capabilities: trigger
  fileinfo
    capabilities: trigger
  kubernetes
    schemes: ["core.openfeature.dev/"]
    capabilities: streaming
  http
    schemes: ["http://" "https://"]
    capabilities: fetcher
  grpc
    schemes: ["grpc://" "grpcs://" "envoy" "dns" "uds" "xds"]
    capabilities: streaming
  gcs
    schemes: ["gs://"]
    capabilities: fetcher
  azblob
    schemes: ["azblob://"]
    capabilities: fetcher
  s3
    schemes: ["s3://"]
    capabilities: fetcher
configuration format
  flagd (built in; the default of a source that names none)
evaluator
  jsonlogic for the configuration format flagd (built in)
service endpoints
  flag-evaluation
    needs: router=true format=""
  ofrep
    needs: router=true format=""
  flag-sync
    needs: router=false format=""
metrics handler override: false
telemetry provider: false
